<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>GitOps Network Pipeline</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
    td { padding: .35rem .8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; vertical-align: top; }
    code { background: #f2f2f2; padding: .1rem .3rem; }
    .ok { color: #1a7f37; font-weight: 600; } .no { color: #c62828; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>GitOps Network Pipeline</h1>
  <p>Red creada con <b>OpenTofu</b>, servidor configurado con <b>Ansible</b>, desplegado por <b>GitHub Actions</b>.</p>
  <table>
    <tr><td>Servidor</td><td><code>{{ ansible_hostname }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>IPs (DMZ / backend)</td><td>{% for ip in ansible_facts.all_ipv4_addresses | default([]) | sort %}<code>{{ ip }}</code> {% endfor %}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Commit desplegado</td><td><code>{{ git_sha }}</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Reglas de firewall</td><td>{% for r in firewall_rules %}<code>{{ r.name }}: {{ r.port }}/tcp desde {{ r.source }}</code><br>{% endfor %}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>DB en red backend</td><td>{% if db_check.rc == 0 %}<span class="ok">alcanzable (solo desde servidores)</span>{% else %}<span class="no">no alcanzable</span>{% endif %}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Fecha despliegue</td><td><code>{{ ansible_date_time.iso8601 }}</code></td></tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
